    "title": "MaryAnn Gawley, Devoted Matriarch and Banquet Planner, Passes Away at 95",
    "text": "MaryAnn Gawley | Vandenberg Funeral Home - Tinley Park\nMaryAnn Gawley | Vandenberg Funeral Home - Tinley Park\nA loving mother to Thomas, Severin \"Ted\", Nanci, Tim, and the late Cheryl Gawley, MaryAnn was also a devoted grandmother and great-grandmother to a cherished family. She found her passion in organizing banquets and parties at Prestwick Country Club, infusing joy into countless celebrations. Yet, her greatest joy came from being surrounded by family and friends, and attending church, where her welcoming and warm spirit created a sense of home for all.\nPreceded in death by her parents, Theodore and Wilemina Oostema, and siblings Theodore, Edward, Margaret, and Ruth, MaryAnn's legacy of love and kindness will endure.\nVisitation will be held on Tuesday, July 29, 2025, at Vandenberg Funeral Home in Tinley Park, with a funeral service on Wednesday at 10:00 AM, followed by interment at Tinley Park Memorial Cemetery.\nIn honor of MaryAnn Gawley, donations and messages of sympathy can be expressed through the flower store. MaryAnn will be remembered for her unwavering love, warm spirit, and dedication to her family and community.\nClick here to read the original obituary.",
